    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome all players to join the official QQ discussion group: 743954971</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cave, raise a toast to Impermanence,<br>On the Bridge of No Return, resent the King of Hell.<br>With a swing of the iron stick, demons are startled,<br>My fate is determined by me, not by the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff automatically attacks enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various staff spells with different elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute finishing moves with a combination of five staff spells!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the underworld and hell from Chinese mythology, with randomly generated levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse your iron staff with materials, freely adjust its attributes, and create your unique iron stick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave of demon attacks lasts 60-90 seconds. Find ways to defeat as many enemies as possible and survive during this period!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect charms and materials dropped by demons, and during the intervals between each wave, draw and combine your staff techniques!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome all players to join the official QQ discussion group: 743954971</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cave, raise a toast to Impermanence,<br>On the Bridge of No Return, resent the King of Hell.<br>With a swing of the iron stick, demons are startled,<br>My fate is determined by me, not by the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff automatically attacks enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various staff spells with different elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute finishing moves with a combination of five staff spells!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the underworld and hell from Chinese mythology, with randomly generated levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse your iron staff with materials, freely adjust its attributes, and create your unique iron stick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave of demon attacks lasts 60-90 seconds. Find ways to defeat as many enemies as possible and survive during this period!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect charms and materials dropped by demons, and during the intervals between each wave, draw and combine your staff techniques!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
